#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:1
msgid "Multi-Objective Optimization"
msgstr "多目的最適化"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:3
msgid ""
"Solve multi-objective optimization problems with trade-offs between "
"objectives, using `saealib`."
msgstr "目的間にトレードオフのある多目的最適化問題を、`saealib`で解きます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:5
msgid ""
"Regardless of the number of objectives, switching algorithms, surrogates,"
" and the evaluation strategy works the same as in \"Switching "
"components\" in [Single-Objective Optimization](single_objective.md)."
msgstr "アルゴリズム、サロゲート、評価戦略の切り替え方は、目的数によらず[単目的最適化](single_objective.md)の「コンポーネントの切り替え」と共通です。"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:7
msgid ""
"This page covers what's specific to problems with two or more objectives:"
" choosing a comparator and extracting the Pareto front."
msgstr "このページでは、目的数が2以上のときに固有の設定である、比較演算子の選択とパレートフロントの抽出を扱います。"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:9
msgid "Problem setup"
msgstr "問題設定"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:11
msgid ""
"When multiple objective functions are in a trade-off relationship, there "
"exist solutions where improving one worsens another."
msgstr "複数の目的関数がトレードオフの関係にあるとき、一方を改善するともう一方が悪化する解が存在します。"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:13
msgid ""
"Under this relationship, the set of solutions not dominated by any other "
"solution in every objective is called the **Pareto front**."
msgstr "この関係の下で、他のどの解にも全目的で優越されない解の集合を**パレートフロント**と呼びます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:15
msgid "Here, as an example, we minimize the ZDT1 function built into `saealib`."
msgstr "ここでは例として、`saealib`に組み込まれたZDT1関数を最小化します。"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:23
msgid ""
"`zdt1` is a `Problem` instance returning a two-objective benchmark "
"problem with a convex Pareto front."
msgstr "`zdt1`は、凸形のパレートフロントを持つ2目的のベンチマーク問題を返す`Problem`インスタンスです。"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:25
msgid "High-level API: minimize"
msgstr "高レベルAPI：minimize"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:27
msgid ""
"Passing a `Problem` instance directly carries over the number of "
"objectives from it."
msgstr "`Problem`インスタンスを直接渡すと、目的数はそこから引き継がれます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:38
msgid ""
"Where `result.x`/`result.f` were a single point in the single-objective "
"case, in the multi-objective case they become multiple solutions forming "
"the Pareto front."
msgstr "単目的では1点だった`result.x`/`result.f`は、多目的ではパレートフロントを構成する複数の解になります。"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:40
msgid "Choosing a comparator"
msgstr "比較演算子の選択"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:42
msgid ""
"In multi-objective optimization, `Comparator` decides the relative "
"superiority between candidate solutions."
msgstr "多目的では、候補解同士の優劣を`Comparator`が決めます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:44
msgid ""
"If `Problem`'s `comparator` argument is omitted, one is auto-selected "
"based on the number of objectives (`SingleObjectiveComparator` when "
"`n_obj == 1`, `NSGA2Comparator` when `n_obj > 1`)."
msgstr "`Problem`の`comparator`引数を省略すると、目的数に応じて自動選択されます（`n_obj == 1`なら`SingleObjectiveComparator`、`n_obj > 1`なら`NSGA2Comparator`）。"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md
msgid "Class"
msgstr "クラス"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "動作"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md
msgid "`NSGA2Comparator`"
msgstr "`NSGA2Comparator`"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md
msgid ""
"Diversity maintenance via non-dominated sorting and crowding distance "
"(default)"
msgstr "非優越ソートと混雑度による多様性維持（既定）"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md
msgid "`SPEA2Comparator`"
msgstr "`SPEA2Comparator`"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md
msgid "Fitness based on strength of dominance and neighborhood density"
msgstr "優越関係の強さと近傍密度によるフィットネス"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md
msgid "`HypervolumeComparator`"
msgstr "`HypervolumeComparator`"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md
msgid "Superiority judged by hypervolume contribution"
msgstr "ハイパーボリューム貢献度による優劣判定"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md
msgid "`EpsilonDominanceComparator`"
msgstr "`EpsilonDominanceComparator`"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md
msgid "Superiority judged by epsilon-dominance"
msgstr "εドミナンスによる優越判定"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md
msgid "`NSGA3Comparator`"
msgstr "`NSGA3Comparator`"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md
msgid "Diversity maintenance via reference points. Requires `reference_points`"
msgstr "参照点による多様性維持。`reference_points`が必須"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md
msgid "`RNSGA2Comparator`"
msgstr "`RNSGA2Comparator`"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md
msgid ""
"Concentrates solutions near specified reference points. Requires "
"`reference_points`"
msgstr "指定した参照点の近傍へ解を集中させる。`reference_points`が必須"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:55
msgid "`comparator` can be swapped as an attribute of the `Problem` instance."
msgstr "`comparator`は`Problem`インスタンスの属性として差し替えられます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:64
msgid "Extracting the Pareto front"
msgstr "パレートフロントの抽出"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:66
msgid "After running, `result.ctx.pareto_archive` holds the final Pareto front."
msgstr "実行後、`result.ctx.pareto_archive`には最終的なパレートフロントが保持されています。"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:73
msgid ""
"To compute the Pareto front from an arbitrary array of objective values, "
"you can use `non_dominated_sort` directly."
msgstr "任意の目的値配列からパレートフロントを求めたい場合は、`non_dominated_sort`を直接使えます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:83
msgid "References"
msgstr "参照"

